# Dancing with friends and enemies: boids' swarm intelligence
Adapted from [Wolfram Community](https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/122095). Written by *Simon Woods*

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
# Dancing with friends and enemies: boids' swarm intelligence
Adapted from [Wolfram Community](https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/122095). Written by *Simon Woods*

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
- 100 dancers assume random positions on the dance-floor.
- Each randomly chooses one "friend" and one "enemy".
- At each step every dancer
  - moves 0.5% closer to the centre of the floor
  - then takes a large step towards their friend and a small step away from their enemy.
- At random intervals one dancer re-chooses their friend and enemy

Randomness is deliberately injected. Here is the dance...

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
- 100 dancers assume random positions on the dance-floor.
- Each randomly chooses one "friend" and one "enemy".
- At each step every dancer
  - moves 0.5% closer to the centre of the floor
  - then takes a large step towards their friend and a small step away from their enemy.
- At random intervals one dancer re-chooses their friend and enemy

Randomness is deliberately injected. Here is the dance...

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Please, evaluate initialization cells first or go one by one 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Please, evaluate initialization cells first or go one by one 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  InitGroup: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ClearAll[n,r,f,s,x,v,p,q,colors];

n = 100;
r := RandomInteger[{1, n}];
f := (#/(.05 + Sqrt[#.#])) & /@ (x[[#]] - x) &;
s := With[{r1 = r}, p[[r1]] = r; q[[r1]] = r];
x = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, {n, 2}];
v = {#,#} &/@ x // NumericArray;
{p, q} = RandomInteger[{1, n}, {2, n}];
colors = RGBColor[#/n // N,0.3,0.5] &/@ Range[n];

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
__Main render function__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
__Main render function__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  InitGroup: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
fps = 0;
fpsLabel = "0";
time = AbsoluteTime[];
defaults = <|"p"->0.03, "q"->0.02|>;

handler = Function[Null,
  With[{new = 0.995 x + defaults["p"] f[p] - defaults["q"] f[q]},
    v = {5 #[[1]], 5 #[[1]] + 30 #[[2]]} &/@ Transpose[{new, new - x}] // NumericArray;
    x = new;
  ];
  
  If[r < 100, s];

  (* FPS counter *)
  fps += 1;
  With[{diff = AbsoluteTime[] - time},
    If[diff >= 1.0,
      fpsLabel = ToString[fps / (diff)];
      fps = 0;
      time = AbsoluteTime[];
    ];
  ];
];

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
__Drawing function__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
__Drawing function__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Graphics[{
  PointSize[0.007], Table[With[{i = i, c = colors[[i]]},
    {c, Arrow[v[[i]] // Offload]}
  ], {i, n}],
  EventHandler[AnimationFrameListener[v // Offload], handler],
  Text[fpsLabel // Offload, {-1.8,1.8}]
}, PlotRange -> {{-2,2}, {-2,2}}, "TransitionDuration"->10, ImageSize->Medium]  

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
